{"ref":"BDB, זַכּוּר","hw":"זַכּוּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַכּוּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ζακχυρ, Ζακχουρ, etc.:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Reubenite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:4\" href=\"/Numbers.13.4\">Nu 13:4</a> (P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Simeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.26\">1 Ch 4:26</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.27\">1 Ch 24:27</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  an Asaphite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.2\">1 Ch 25:2</a> (Σακχους), v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.10\">10</a> (Ζαχχουθ), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.35\">Ne 12:35</a> (Ζακχουρ), cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זִכְרִי\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זִכְרִי\">זִכְרִי</a> supr. <strong>3 c.</strong> <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.13\">Ne 10:13</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.13\">13:13</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  companion of Ezra, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:14\" href=\"/Ezra.8.14\">Ezr 8:14</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">זבוד</span>, cf. supr. p. 256 a).<br><strong>5.</strong>  contemp. of Nehemiah, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.2\">Ne 3:2</a>.","next":"BDB, זִכָּרוֹן","prev":"BDB, זִכְרִי"}